    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ghwaramoar Sibaneeda deakta ashoohoocheanda haw",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geahiimnaan Yoshuwa was ashoohoocheanda haw, nea ghamiinaada aba madeeda malaykajeanda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak ghamiinaada shataani aba meatkweeda geatindaanyi bea dugwa ghoahaakta niny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwayeesha shataani, “Gagasa goowoowseey NG'UTAMIIDA, Ea Shataani! Gagasa goowoowseey NG'UTAMIIDA loat Yerusalemu! Siisi gawuurji bileangida silealna jeeda beasta?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshuwa abeeda ghamiinaada aba madeeda Malaykajeanda nea gaba hang'weaka munyas bea ririnnyeanda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda malaykajeanda ak gwayeesha fugiga miinaada aba madeadaanyiin, “Ageanda hang'weakiga munyas bea ririnyeandean,” ak gwayeesha niny “ng'ula neageandeawaneey ng'asheagaagu munyas, ak gaydanung' akweala hang'weaka sheayeeda haw.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geayeeshi, “Ayiina weasta miy uhuudaanyi.” Hean geayiin weasta miy uhuudaanyi nea geekwealsa hang'weaka ak ghamiinaada malaykajeanda NG'UTAMIIDA aba murdeadaanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha malaykajeanda NG'UTAMIIDA Yoshuwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Hean gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA bea lugweega, inyas giyaadi naweadingeasu nea giing'waanyi ng'asheegeasu, abeeda gajambala gheenyu nea giimbali muhealuutkeasu, ak gaydagoonyi gheata jea asiipsiinana fuga miinaada aba hiji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aleaydiit ghamneawa Ea Yoshuwa ashoohoocheanda haw, ang'iing'i ea fugaagu irooroocheewi mida madeadaang'u aba gideaba suh fuga was gwadeagooda miyas gil aba gideaba ng'ula gaydeadu siideanyu bea gadiyeeda siguura Damealeanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba ng'ula lagheaneani aayiinyi madeeda Yoshuwahiin, jeemba lagheaneanagi gwanda gheanyan ispwa, ng'ula gaydang'waar ng'ooruutkaaschi, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA bea lugweega, ak gaydageanda ng'asheega munyas bea ng'eanyiini eaweecheanjagi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eaweedida, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA bea lugweega, gaygaba siisi guursa giischeewoocheandaanyi ak goobiitpiit guumda sabiibu ea guumda shaboogheecheanda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
